OL,3,GNEWSATrain services disrupted due to
OL,4,Aongoing security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have been suspended
OL,7,Funtil further notice due to an ongoing
OL,8,Fsecurity alert in Lurgan, County
OL,9,FArmagh.
OL,11,FTranslink said a rail replacement bus
OL,12,Fsubstitution service is in place
OL,13,Fbetween Belfast and Portadown. Dublin
OL,14,Fpassengers will travel by bus between
OL,15,FBelfast and Newry.
OL,17,FPassengers are being advised to check
OL,18,Fbefore they travel and to allow extra
OL,19,Ftime for their journey.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
